@startuml notification-sequence
' Status: Draft. AI-generated; not human reviewed (Constitution Principle VII).
' Syntax not yet checked: PlantUML is not available on the authoring machine.
' Written design: specs/001-splitsmart-expense-sharing/contracts/service-contracts.md
title Notifications (FR-017, FR-019, FR-023; Draft)

actor "Group member\n(not the creator)" as Member
participant ExpenseService
participant ApprovalService
participant NotificationService
participant "NotificationsPanel\nNotificationController" as NotificationUi
database Repositories

== Created with the expense, in the same transaction (FR-017, SC-006) ==
ExpenseService -> NotificationService : notifyExpenseCreated(expense)
NotificationService -> Repositories : findCurrentMembers(groupId)
Repositories --> NotificationService : current members only
NotificationService -> NotificationService : exclude the creator
NotificationService -> Repositories : insertAll(EXPENSE_CREATED notifications)
note right of NotificationService
  Message states creator, group, description, amount, and date.
  Former members receive nothing (Story 7 scenario 4).
  In-application only (ID-08). FR-018 is Post-MVP.
end note

== Decision notice to the creator (FR-023) ==
ApprovalService -> NotificationService : notifyExpenseDecided(expense, decision)
NotificationService -> Repositories : insert EXPENSE_APPROVED or EXPENSE_REJECTED for the creator
note right of NotificationService : Includes the reason, if any.

== Read at login or on refresh (FR-019) ==
Member -> NotificationUi : log in, or open Notifications
NotificationUi -> NotificationService : unreadCount(actor)
NotificationService -> Repositories : countUnread(actor)
NotificationService --> NotificationUi : count
NotificationUi -> NotificationService : listMine(actor)
NotificationService -> Repositories : findByRecipient(actor), newest first
NotificationService -> Repositories : load linked expenses
NotificationService -> NotificationService : compute needsApproval
note right of NotificationService
  FR-017: true only if the expense is PENDING and the recipient
  is a participant other than the creator. Computed, not stored,
  so it disappears once the expense is decided.
end note
NotificationService --> NotificationUi : NotificationView list
NotificationUi --> Member : show list and "needs your approval" markers

Member -> NotificationUi : mark as read
NotificationUi -> NotificationService : markRead(actor, id)
NotificationService -> Repositories : markRead(id, recipient = actor, now)
alt not this user's notification
  NotificationService --> NotificationUi : NotFoundException
else marked
  NotificationService --> NotificationUi : done; unread count refreshes
end

@enduml
